@startuml
robust "Web Browser" as WB
concise "Web User" as WU

@WB
0 is idle
+200 is Proc.
+100 is Waiting

@WU
0 is Waiting
+500 is ok

@200
note top of WU : first note\non several\nlines
note bottom of WU : second note\non several\nlines
@300
note top of WB
  a long note
  on two lines
end note
@enduml
